  "instance_name": "cold_weather_comfort_concept",
  "label": "Cold Weather Comfort Concept",
  "description": "The meme relies on the cultural understanding that enjoying a warm beverage in cold weather is a universally relatable and comforting experience. This concept is rooted in human physiology and social behavior — warmth is associated with safety, coziness, and emotional well-being, especially in contrast to harsh environments. The image evokes this by juxtaposing the woman’s warm attire and beverage with the cold, open landscape.",
